{
    "id":  11499,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Recessed LED Downlight 6W - 9W - 12W - LUXURY - Bridgelux Chip - UGR11 - 3CCT - CRI +92",
    "reference":  "SP12W-CCT-91360",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhite Luxury LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e offers \u003cstrong\u003eselectable power 6W, 9W and 12W\u003c/strong\u003e, with \u003cstrong\u003eBridgelux Chip 130Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e for exceptional efficiency. Its \u003cstrong\u003e3CCT technology (3000K - 4000K - 5700K)\u003c/strong\u003e allows adjusting color temperature according to desired environment. With UGR11 to minimize glare and CRI+92 for impeccable color reproduction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts 24º beam angle directs light with precision, while its \u003cstrong\u003eSelectable front ring (white or black)\u003c/strong\u003e adapts to any decorative style.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Recessed Downlight 6W - 9W - 12W Luxury White - Bridgelux Chip - UGR11 - 3CCT - CRI +92\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover \u003cstrong\u003elighting excellence\u003c/strong\u003e with the \u003cstrong\u003eLuxury White LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e, a versatile and efficient solution designed to deliver \u003cstrong\u003emaximum performance and visual comfort\u003c/strong\u003e in any space. Thanks to its advanced technology and premium features, this downlight adapts to a wide range of applications, providing superior-quality lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLuxury White LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is designed to \u003cstrong\u003esuit the needs of every space\u003c/strong\u003e. Its \u003cstrong\u003eselectable power\u003c/strong\u003e option makes it possible to optimise energy consumption without sacrificing brightness. In addition, \u003cstrong\u003e3CCT technology\u003c/strong\u003e makes it easy to select the most suitable colour temperature for each environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003einterchangeable front ring\u003c/strong\u003e also allows the design of the downlight to be matched to different decorative styles. The white ring is included as standard, but if the \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Front\u003c/strong\u003e option is selected, an additional black ring is supplied for \u003cstrong\u003eeasy installation\u003c/strong\u003e and greater customisation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a \u003cstrong\u003e75 mm cut-out diameter\u003c/strong\u003e, this downlight fits easily into most recessed installations. Its clip system allows \u003cstrong\u003equick, safe and hassle-free mounting\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring a firm fixing to the ceiling.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the \u003c/strong\u003eLUXURY 12W LED Recessed Downlight with Selectable Light 3CCT and Bridgelux chip\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSelectable power\u003c/strong\u003e: 6W - 9W - 12W, allowing the intensity to be adjusted to the needs of the environment.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBridgelux chip 130Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, guaranteeing powerful lighting with high energy efficiency.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3CCT (3000K - 4000K - 5700K)\u003c/strong\u003e to choose between warm, neutral or cool light according to the desired atmosphere.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e24º beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for focused lighting on specific areas.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow glare emission (UGR11)\u003c/strong\u003e for greater visual comfort and reduced eye strain.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh colour rendering (CRI+92)\u003c/strong\u003e for vibrant, realistic colours.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eManufactured from high-quality aluminium\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring strength and durability.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterchangeable front ring:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e         - Supplied as standard with the \u003cstrong\u003ewhite ring\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003e         - Option to receive an \u003cstrong\u003eadditional black ring\u003c/strong\u003e by selecting the \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Front\u003c/strong\u003e option.\u003cbr /\u003e         - Quick and easy change, no tools required.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e75 mm cut-out diameter\u003c/strong\u003e, compatible with standard installations.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern, elegant design\u003c/strong\u003e, integrating perfectly into any space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, its optimised design and high-quality aluminium promote \u003cstrong\u003eheat dissipation\u003c/strong\u003e, extending the service life of the LED and maintaining stable performance over time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended applications for the \u003c/strong\u003eLUXURY 12W LED Recessed Downlight with Selectable Light and Bridgelux chip\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to its elegant design and professional-quality lighting, the \u003cstrong\u003eLuxury White LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is perfect for:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✔ \u003cstrong\u003eHomes\u003c/strong\u003e – Living rooms, kitchens, hallways, bedrooms and bathrooms.\u003cbr /\u003e ✔ \u003cstrong\u003eShops and retail\u003c/strong\u003e – Lighting for shop windows, display cabinets and exhibition areas.\u003cbr /\u003e ✔ \u003cstrong\u003eOffices and workspaces\u003c/strong\u003e – Efficient, comfortable lighting for long working days.\u003cbr /\u003e ✔ \u003cstrong\u003eHotels and restaurants\u003c/strong\u003e – Creating welcoming, sophisticated atmospheres.\u003cbr /\u003e ✔ \u003cstrong\u003eHospitals and clinics\u003c/strong\u003e – Precise, glare-free light for healthcare spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage contents\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✔ 1 Luxury White LED Downlight with white ring.\u003cbr /\u003e ✔ Option to receive an additional black ring by selecting \"Black Front\".\u003cbr /\u003e ✔ Installation manual for quick, safe mounting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical datasheet for each LED product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
